-CellAspectRatio: 1.46
-ReadMode: voltage
-AccessType: CMOS
-AccessCMOSWidth (F): 1.31
-DRAMCellCapacitance (F): 13e-15
-ResetVoltage (V): vdd
-SetVoltage (V): vdd
-MinSenseVoltage (mV): 10

// Device Library metadata (authoritative values used by SCOPE)
-ScopeDevice: 2D-eDRAM
-ScopeReadLatencyHybrid: Lr_s_Nrow
-ScopeReadLatencyPure: Lr_d_Nrow
-ScopeSelectedReadPath: hybrid
-ScopeReadEnergy: Er_Nrow
